                                    <div class="p-3 rounded-4 h-100" style="background:#0f172a; border:1px solid #334155;">
                                        <div class="fw-bold text-warning mb-2"><i class="bi bi-globe2 me-1"></i> 2. Kendi Domaininizi & Web Sitenizi Yönetin</div>
